flowchart TB
  subgraph ANDROID[Android application — phone-only branch]
    direction TB
    ACT[MainActivity / MyApplication initialization]
    UI[Jetpack Compose screens — Analyzer, Strategies, Calendar, Risk, Settings]
    VM[ViewModels and screen state]
    DOMAIN[Domain use cases and analysis models]
    REPO[Market-data and local repositories]
    PROVIDERS[Selected feed adapters]
    PUBLIC[TradingView scanner / Binance REST / configured OANDA / calendar sources]
    ROOM[(Room local database)]
    POLICY[ReadOnlyExecutionPolicy — reject before broker access]
    ACT --> UI --> VM --> DOMAIN --> REPO
    REPO --> PROVIDERS --> PUBLIC
    REPO --> ROOM
    DOMAIN --> POLICY
  end
  subgraph LEGACY[Separate legacy execution-capable code — not a read-only service]
    BRIDGE[FastAPI bridge / SQLite]
    WORKER[Windows managed worker]
    EA[MT5 Expert Advisor]
    BROKER[MT5 broker]
    WORKER <-->|legacy HTTPS protocol| BRIDGE
    EA <-->|legacy HTTPS protocol| BRIDGE
    EA <-->|MT5 protocol| BROKER
  end
  APP[Android app] -. optional configured HTTPS; not required for local analysis .-> BRIDGE
  WARNING[Legacy transaction paths remain in source; no deployment or full read-only proof]
  WARNING -. applies to .-> LEGACY
